    "body": "> how do i do this?\n\nGenerally follow the pattern elsewhere. Near the bottom, appropriately alphabetized, something like\n\n```\n   <dt id=\"refsCSSATTR\">[CSSATTR]</dt>\n   <dd><cite><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-style-attr/\">CSS Styling Attribute Syntax</a></cite>, T. &Ccedil;elik, E. Etemad. W3C.</dd>\n```\n\nthen at the place of reference, use `<ref spec=CSSATTR>`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
